suite, while two additional bedrooms, a full bath & upper-floor laundry complete the level. The unfinished basement offers space to create a rec room, home gym or additional living area to suit your needs. The double detached garage features a recently installed additional plug-in. Recent improvements also include a new furnace installed this summer & new leaf guards. With schools, parks, walking trails & local amenities nearby, this home puts the best of Morinville within easy reach! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$459,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,529 sq ft"],["Lot size","3,640 sq ft"],["Year built","2009"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Morinville"],["Town","Morinville"],["Postal code","T8R0C2"],["MLS® number","E4516373"],["Listed","November 13, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave, Hood Fan, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.01 m × 4.10 m (13'2\" × 13'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.83 m × 3.09 m (12'7\" × 10'2\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.62 m × 4.95 m (15'2\" × 16'3\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.84 m × 3.93 m (12'7\" × 12'11\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.92 m × 3.84 m (9'7\" × 12'7\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","2.82 m × 3.23 m (9'3\" × 10'7\")"]],"courtesy":"Meghan MacGregor, RE/MAX Excellence and Ian Robertson, RE/MAX Excellence","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"morinville","hood_slug":"","area":""}